    "name":  "LED Lamp bulb -  50W - 130Lm/W - E27 - IP20",
    "reference":  "LB50W-91120-3K",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThis \u003cstrong\u003e50W LED bulb\u003c/strong\u003e is not only energy efficient, but also offers an exceptionally bright and consistent lighting performance, providing a bright and welcoming ambiance in any application in which it is used. In addition, with its long lifespan, this LED bulb will last much longer than traditional bulbs, meaning you will need to replace them much less frequently, saving time, money on maintenance costs and above all being more environmentally friendly.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Lamp 50W - 130Lm/W - E27\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 50W LED lamp with a light output of 130Lm/W is an excellent choice for those seeking bright and efficient lighting at home or in the office. With its modern and elegant design, this E27 LED bulb fits any environment and is easy to install in any compatible lamp socket.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its high brightness, the 50W LED lamp is also very energy-efficient, consuming significantly less energy than traditional bulbs. This means that not only will you save on your electricity bill, but you will also contribute to reducing carbon footprint and protecting the environment.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a long lifespan, this LED lamp will last much longer than conventional bulbs, which means you\u0027ll have to replace it much less frequently, saving you time and money on maintenance costs. Additionally, the 50W LED lamp offers consistent and bright illumination, making it an excellent choice for illuminating large spaces such as living rooms, kitchens, offices, and stores.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith a 270-degree beam angle, this LED lamp is capable of illuminating a wide area without leaving dark areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 6500 lumens of this LED bulb offer exceptionally bright and consistent lighting, allowing for uniform illumination throughout the room, without dark spots or poorly lit areas. With a power of 50W, this LED lamp is capable of providing brighter illumination than traditional incandescent bulbs, but with much lower energy consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you\u0027re looking for a high-quality LED bulb with exceptional performance, the 50W LED lamp is definitely an excellent choice. Whether for residential or commercial use, this LED bulb offers efficient and quality lighting that will meet all your lighting needs. So don\u0027t wait any longer and make the transition to LED lighting with the 50W LED lamp, offering 3630 lumens and an E27 base.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications LED Lamp 50W - 6500Lm - E27 - IP20\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupermarkets and indoor garages.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShops and general stores.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorkshops and warehouses.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReplaces 150W E40 halogen bulbs and 250W E40 sodium vapor bulbs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndustrial warehouses.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAny indoor area with high ceilings or large spaces.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED, we ensure that our products are of high quality and offer all the necessary elements for distribution, importation, or wholesale sales, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
